## : Write a function PatternMatching() that solves the Pattern Matching Problem. Then add PatternMatching() to Replication.py.
def PatternMatching(Pattern,Genome):
    positions=[]
    n=len(Genome)
    k=len(Pattern)
    for i in range(n-k+1):
        if Genome[i:i+k]==Pattern:
            positions.append(i)
    return positions        
